sSize(DEFAULT_MIN_ZSTD_SIZE);","     }"," ","+    /**","+     * @return the capacity of the {@link ZstdCompressCtx} pool, or a negative value for the default capacity","+     * @see #setCompressCtxPoolCapacity(int)","+     */","+    public int getCompressCtxPoolCapacity()","+    {","+        return compressCtxPoolCapacity;","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * <p>Sets the capacity of the {@link ZstdCompressCtx} pool.</p>","+     * <p>Each pooled context retains its native workspace (about 3.5 MiB at the default compression level,","+     * more at higher levels) for as long as the pool lives, so the capacity bounds the native memory that","+     * idle contexts retain; when the pool is full, the contexts in excess are created and freed for each","+     * response.</p>","+     *","+     * @param compressCtxPoolCapacity the capacity of the pool, {@code 0} to disable pooling, or a negative","+     * value for the default capacity of {@value ZstandardCompressCtxPool#DEFAULT_CAPACITY}","+     */","+    public void setCompressCtxPoolCapacity(int compressCtxPoolCapacity)","+    {","+        if (isRunning())","+            throw new IllegalStateException(\"Cannot set the compression context pool capacity on a running component\");","+        this.compressCtxPoolCapacity = compressCtxPoolCapacity;","+    }","+","     @Override","     public RetainableByteBuffer.Mutable acquireByteBuffer(int length)","     {","@@ -89,6 +119,11 @@ public RetainableByteBuffer.Mutable acquireByteBuffer(int length)","         return buffer;","     }"," ","+    ZstandardCompressCtxPool getCompressCtxPool()","+    {","+        return compressCtxPool;","+    }","+","     @Override","     public HttpField getContentEncodingField()","     {","@@ -171,8 +206,30 @@ public OutputStream newEncoderOutputStream(OutputStream out, EncoderConfig confi","     @Override","     public EncoderSink newEncoderSink(Content.Sink sink, EncoderConfig config)","     {","+        ZstandardCompressCtxPool compressCtxPool = thi